{
  "format_version": "1.0",
  "target": "research_target",
  "notes": "Ground truth for the researcher-stage evaluation (evals/research_eval.py). Sixteen findings across a 26-file package tree; fourteen require connecting a source route to a sink in another module (cross_file=true), several through a three-hop web -> services -> dal/integrations chain, which is the capability structural navigation tools are expected to improve. This file is EXCLUDED from the copy of the target placed in the eval jail, so the model never sees the answers. A finding matches an entry when its filepath matches any entry in 'files' AND its title+description+cwe mention any phrase in 'match_any' (case-insensitive substring).",
